 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the fourth day they weighed the silver",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gold and vessels in the house of our God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the hands of the priests they went",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the Levites standing close by",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Josaphat son of Jeshua was there",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Noadiah son of Binnui too",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Weighing out what was brought from exile",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Recording all that the people gave",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In charge of the outside work",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of the house of God he stood",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Keeping the charge of his God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the singers and gatekeepers did",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Levites explained the Law",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While the people remained in their places",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jeshua Bani Sherebiah",
   "heard": 2,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jamin Akkub Shabbethai Hodiah",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Maaseiah Kelita Azariah",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Jozabad Hanan and Pelaiah",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They made the words plain and clear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the assembly gathered there",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In charge of the outside work",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
